                    <name>richTextValue</name>
                    <value>&lt;p&gt;Hello,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It was lovely meeting you today! Thank you for your interest in Zeta Charter Schools and being part of the Zeta experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Applications for the 2027-2028 school year are open. Please take a few minutes to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://myportal.zetaschools.org/&quot;&gt;apply today!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Once you do, your family will be invited to join upcoming events to learn more about Zeta&amp;rsquo;s next-generation education.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Zeta is a public charter school network that provides a tuition-free, pre-K through high school journey in the Bronx, Manhattan, and Queens. Our whole-child approach combines rigorous academics, expert-led Specialty classes, and a joyful community where students are known and loved. At Zeta, students discover their strengths and passions as they prepare for college and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can submit an application for the 2027-28 school year using either option below:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Apply online: Complete the&lt;a href=&quot;https://myportal.zetaschools.org/&quot;&gt; application on our website.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;or&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Reply to this email with the following information:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Student&amp;rsquo;s full first and last name&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Student&amp;rsquo;s date of birth (month/day/year)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Student&amp;rsquo;s grade for 2027&amp;ndash;2028&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Student&amp;rsquo;s full home address&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Phone number&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li aria-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Preferred Zeta school(s)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions as you&lt;a href=&quot;https://myportal.zetaschools.org/&quot;&gt; complete your application&lt;/a&gt;, please reach out at enroll@zetaschools.org or call us at (646) 480-1654.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
Warmly,&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;The Zeta Enrollment Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Zeta Charter Schools&lt;br /&gt;
___________________________&lt;br /&gt;
